Không yêu cầu

**JOB DESCRIPTION** 

* Build up, train, and manage a sales team, scales of 5\-8 members;
* Assist Sales Manager in developing sales strategy and plans to achieve agreed targets, effectively search for leads/prospects, penetrate new markets (Singapore, Malaysia, Thailand, Hongkong, New Zealand, Netherlands, UK, US, Australia…)
* Advise and support team members to prepare and deliver client/customer presentations, proposals, and price lists;
* Generate and manage sales pipeline to ensure to reach the team’s KPI;
* Reporting (content and format as agreed) on a monthly basis to the Sales Manager;
* Review and upgrade internal sales process compliance;
* Develop a thorough understanding of products and services; develope new business with existing clients and/or identify areas of improvement to meet sales quotas;
* Combine with clients and internal departments to close deals and implement projects.
* Work Location: Ha Noi, Ho Chi Minh, Japan, Singapore, Korea, Malaysia.

**REQUIREMENTS**

* 4\+\+ years of experience in Sales; which 2 years in management positions (candidates without leadership experience but strong IT sales skills are considerable);
* IT background is an advantage;
* Fluent in verbal and written English (IELTS 7\.0\+\+)/ Korean/ Japanese (N1\)
* Strong communication and interpersonal skills to communicate effectively with internal and external people;
* Ability to work effectively under high pressure \& with cross\-functional teams, good problem\-solving.

**BENEFITS**

* Attractive income: Basic Salary \+ Incentive (according to actual revenue of the team and individual)

Job Type: Full\-time

Work Location: In person
